WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.968
-Finally, guys,
we have exactly 11 shows left

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.567
before we go
on Christmas break,

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.100
which means it's time
for that beloved

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.300
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.968
It's time for 12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters.

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:14.267
♪ 12 days of Christmas
sweaters ♪

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:17.834
♪ 11 days left ♪

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:20.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.567
-That's right.

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:24.200
Every show between now
and Christmas,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.434
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:29.100
a bodacious
Christmas sweater

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.334
from the countdown
to Christmas cabinet.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:36.267
Since there are 11 shows left,
let's open door number 11.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.200
♪♪

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.801
Oh.

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:49.033
♪♪

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:57.434
That's nice.
Thank you very much.

00:00:57.434 --> 00:00:59.868
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.467
Everyone look
at your seat number.

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:05.300
I need you to jump up
and let me know where you are

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.701
if you get --
if I say your number.

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:09.167
Quest,
can I get a drum roll, please?

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.200
Who wants me
to pick their number?

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.167
This is good.

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:14.868
♪♪

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:17.601
-448.

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:19.767
♪♪

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:29.067
♪♪

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:36.234
♪♪

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:39.267
-Alright. Oh, man.

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:41.434
♪♪

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.701
Here we go.

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:45.434
We can do a little --
Come over here. Gosh.

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:50.033
How are you? Barely made it
on the standby line there, huh?

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:53.567
Uh, you don't want to come down
one step towards me? Come on.

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:55.634
Gosh, I just walked up --
How you doing?

00:01:55.634 --> 00:02:00.267
-Hi. Hi, I'm Mark.
-Oh, what is --

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.000
-What is your name?
-Mark.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.467
-Yeah. Uh, Mark,
where are you from?

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:06.133
-I'm from Spain.
-Hey.

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:10.300
Welcome.
Thank you for being here.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.901
Mark, it gets a little chilly
sometimes in Spain, correct?

00:02:12.901 --> 00:02:14.200
-Yeah. It is.
-Yeah. Cold.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.367
Right? I mean, you have this.
This is very nice.

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:19.968
I love this fleece.
Whatever it is, it's gorgeous.

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:23.734
Do you have anything like this?
-No, I don't, I don't, I don't.

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:25.234
-Have you ever seen
anything like this?

00:02:25.234 --> 00:02:27.133
-No.
-No, never.

00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:28.234
Would you like to try it on?

00:02:28.234 --> 00:02:30.167
-Yeah, sure.
-Yeah, I think you should.

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:33.300
You can put it over that.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.734
I want to make it
as uncomfortable as possible.

00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:37.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:39.434
♪♪

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:42.000
And this is the front.
This is the front, I think.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.234
The good thing
about this sweater

00:02:43.234 --> 00:02:46.534
is there's no front or back.

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:49.100
You just put it on and hope
for the best, you know?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.601
Oh, this is great, Mark.
Yeah.

00:02:50.601 --> 00:02:52.834
Oh, yeah. That's right.

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:55.801
Oh, wow. He made it through.
He made it through.

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:57.968
Look at that.
That looks fantastic.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:03:00.834
Look at how good you look.
Fantastic, buddy.

00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:01.834
-Thank you.
-Welcome.

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:02.968
Thank you for being here. Enjoy.

00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:04.334
Happy holidays, buddy.
-Thank you.

00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:05.367
-Give it up for Mark, everybody.

00:03:05.367 --> 00:03:06.868
Stick around.
When we come back,

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:09.300
we're doing something fun
with Anne Hathaway.

